    "note": [
      "Why the cave abomination is animated with the cave horror's 474 seqs. Its vertex label",
      "groups are EXACTLY the horror's two models' combined set, 0-30, with the same shape:",
      "group 9 is two vertices in both, group 20 two, groups 28 and 29 three each. Its other 69",
      "vertices carry label 255, which no frame in anim_474_1091 touches, and all 69 sit at y=0 -",
      "the flat ground plate, which is meant to stay still. Posed and rendered against the horror",
      "before the config was written, because superior_spiked_turoth is what happens when an OSRS",
      "model meets animations it was not rigged for."
    ],
